        <section><h2>1. Identity Sovereignty (The 12-Word Master Key)</h2><p><strong>The Advantage:</strong> Unlike Signal or WhatsApp, SecureMessenger requires zero personal data.</p><ul><li><span class="highlight">Zero Identifiers:</span> No phone numbers, no SIM cards, and no email addresses.</li><li><span class="highlight">Local Generation:</span> Your identity is a private 12-word cryptographic seed generated entirely on your device.</li><li><span class="highlight">Total Ownership:</span> I do not store passwords. If you hold your 12 words, you hold your data.</li></ul></section>
